        {
          "type": "prayer",
          "source": "Domine Jesu Christe, Rex gloriae, libera animas omnium fidelium defunctorum de poenis inferni, et de profundo lacu: libera eas de ore leonis, ne absorbeat eas tartarus, ne cadant in obscurum; sed signifer sanctus Michael repraesentet eas in lucem sanctam, quam olim Abrahae promisisti, et semini ejus.",
          "english": null,
          "sourcePages": [
            611
          ],
          "translation": null,
          "alignment": "single-language",
          "id": "matins-b0001",
          "verification": "pending"
        },
        {
          "type": "prayer",
          "source": "℣. Fidelium animae per misericordiam Dei requiescant in pace.",
          "english": "℣. May the souls of the faithful departed, through the mercy of God, rest in peace.",
